WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:04,130
Everyone, don’t make the same mistake again and again.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:08,360
Miss Liang, it's not our fault

3
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,000
you are wrong

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,880
You want to save this one and that one?

5
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,520
In the end, no one can save me

6
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,520
On the contrary, it will harm those of us who are living well.

7
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:19,740
Take my sister's advice and leave it alone.

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:22,500
A Biao, the gun is in your hand now

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,140
From now on, you will have the final say in this mall.

10
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,420
But my sister still has a suggestion

11
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:30,300
You ask that kid to hand over the car keys

12
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,180
My sister left with a few women who were willing to leave.

13
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,860
I won’t compete with you. Look.

14
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:47,350
The gun is in my hand. How dare you negotiate terms with me?

15
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,950
Brothers from now on

16
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:52,630
The stock belongs to us, there’s no need to hold it back

17
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:54,830
Make a mess for me

18
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:56,840
Miss Liang, save me

19
00:00:56,840 --> 00:01:01,290
What do you mean? You are still not happy with this girl?

20
00:01:01,290 --> 00:01:03,980
I'm telling you, you can't accept any of those three women.

21
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:06,700
How could you get the gun without me?
